{"surah":94,"ayahs":["أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>رَكَ","وَوَضَعْنَا عَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نكَ</span> وِزْرَكَ","ٱلَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ذِىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نقَ</span>ضَ ظَهْرَكَ","وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","فَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> مَعَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> مَعَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نصَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>","وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>رْغَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">ب</span>"]}